omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vx5aB1hLPlAQ7kNvwEVIkxy&_nc_oc=Ado1azLFHEHmhM4H2ZTgb_BOzJaquJfFBtjV-QZbkcS6pLVsymuE7B5jICiaCNuajmw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIsKfji82KvkWs-OspW_pASEVXQudU6Cg-WeCnDi1c44A&oe=6A983F34"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aVM6sCv0QqEQ7kNvwEkIsK3&_nc_oc=AdpvVazfN7QjH9YumMTIRAFkWD44jBwNHo7_N0De1wiodbDiXz_RdvA07xgcNCkWHlI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL6ZQNeEN0DYhWkWh-nNAUXn1ks7X9ZyJhmw3Sx4oCSTg&oe=6A984096"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OC3uomkZgQAQ7kNvwG7d90Y&_nc_oc=AdoFj8_m0c1B4-xi6qws2Le6gJ8Ml9mKOIw_6W69NJyp9MSL_kfc4pz8gF4ERqePN0A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKOMSwv76f_VYKINwBi81A49fn3QY2RuWEZfKxSc1ulag&oe=6A9855B7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://